  "summary": "<p><strong>Cameras in the Courtroom Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Supreme Court to permit television coverage of all open sessions of the Court unless it decides by majority vote that allowing such coverage in a particular case would violate the due process rights of any of the parties before the Court.</p>",
